    "Coronas: %lld": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Crowns: %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En las zonas a ciegas los muros no se ven: el ritmo de las vibraciones dice a qué distancia está el muro, y una textura continua avisa de que pasas por el hueco.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In blind zones the walls are invisible: the rhythm of the vibrations tells you how far away the wall is, and a continuous texture warns you when you're passing through the gap."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Este iPhone no vibra:\nel audio te guía — sube el volumen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This iPhone can't vibrate:\naudio guides you — turn the volume up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hoy": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Today"
          }
        }
      }
    },
